# Membership rules — SEG-WELD-01

Membership is rule-based, not name-based: [job codes WELD1/WELD2](#rule-job)
in [Bays 1–3](#rule-loc) with [≥ 50% shift time on welding tasks](#rule-time);
[toolroom/inspection assignments are excluded](#rule-excl) — which is why
[E-4471's modified-duty period is carved out](#m-4471) (the absence itself is
the employer's case; only the *assignment* matters here). Roster history rides
in the front matter with from/to dates, so "who belonged in February 2026" is
a query, not an argument.
